<title>USA: Colleyville EDC, Texas, won by Griffin Kubik.</title>
<headline>Colleyville EDC, Texas, won by Griffin Kubik.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin Kubik, Stephens &amp; Thompson, Inc. said it won $6.460 million of Colleyville EDC, Texas, sales tax revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.55 percent.</p>
